# CIS Debian Level 1 Server settings that are site decisions.

# 1.4.1 bootloader password: deliberately NOT a variable here. FAI writes every
# variable to variables.log (logs end up on the machine and in CI artifacts), and this
# file is public. Put the hash in config/secrets/grub-password.hash instead (gitignored);
# see README "Setting the GRUB password". Without that file each build gets a random
# password nobody knows.

# 6.1.2.1.2/3 ship the journal to a central log server, e.g. https://logs.example.com:19532
# Empty: upload is left unconfigured and `cis-check` reports it as MANUAL.
JOURNAL_UPLOAD_URL=''
